<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tē^trăpharmăcum</span></b> ,
		i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραφάρμακον.</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A plaster composed of four ingredients</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 4, 28 <i>med.</i></span></i> (in <i><span class="en">Cels. 5, 19, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 26, 35</span></i>, and <i><span class="en">Scrib.
				Comp. 211</span></i>, written as Greek).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A mess of four kinds of food</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Spart. Hadr. 21</span></i>; Ael. Ver. 5;
					<i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 30</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
